    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74989.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "Okay. So to follow up on that, so maybe what producers can look forward to is that right now we're not seeing a lot of buyers at local sale yards. We're just seeing a lot of sellers and a lot of cattle. So there's no real cattle shortage. So with this, you hope that we're maybe going to see more buyers looking at cattle in the ring as well and maybe seeing more bids going towards and driving up prices a little bit.",
