  {
    "episode_id": 74989,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74989.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 30,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think that's particular yet. Let the market determine where the price is. And you only do that if you have competition in that marketplace. And you need to have more than four bikers, basically. As an end result, you need to have more than four. And quite frankly, because there's demand for more than four. And so if we can get more folks into the marketplace, then I think you're going to get more to the true cost of what that product is worth.",
