  {
    "episode_id": 74989,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74989.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 33,
    "turn_text": "So you mentioned that President Biden is seemingly more interested in this, maybe a little bit more than kind of what we've seen with past administrations and moving forward towards making competition better within agriculture. So do you see the Biden administration maybe taking more hands on approach that we've seen in the past?",
